{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54790","headline":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占北斗，第一是妖星。\n却（京本作「都」）要分明军（辛本、川本、京本作「君」）始吉，忽然不现衆星明。\n主将落奸情。\n（妖星乃贪狼星也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}